# Jatun Wasi — Unreal MCP Rules

- Always call the mcp-unreal status tool first.
- Confirm the current level before modifying anything.
- Modify only /Game/JWN/MAP_JatunWasi_MCP_V08_HaciendaFix_CLEAN.
- Preserve V05, V06, V07 and all unrelated environment work.
- Save and create a timestamped V08 backup before structural modifications.
- Use get_level_actors, get_actor_components and capture_viewport before editing.
- Use execute_script for controlled Unreal Python batch operations.
- Duplicate shared meshes as V07-only assets before editing them.
- Never claim success from Map Check alone.
- Validate visually and in PIE using BP_XRPawn.
- Save the level after successful validation.
- Never invent measurements, captures or test results.
